      "attainment_is_judged_on_the_tight_cell_cap": "for the in-band cases the contour support cell itself is inside the gate band, so its cap 0.02 u_impact is tight; the bilinear point cap is weaker because the crossing point straddles the band edge, and both are reported so that no looser number is used where a tighter one applies",
