      "instantaneous": "B1/B1b are evaluated on the t=0 state at the frozen phi=0.5 contour cell and crossing point, and are checked there for every admissible state. In the three in-band cases the frozen families place exactly zero normal velocity at that cell, so the initial state exerts no normal advection on the contact contour at all; the in-band downward phase flux is likewise zero to machine level"
